{"title":"Fix Deployment selector mismatch for vigil-app","body":"Root cause: The Deployment manifest had a selector that did not match the pod template labels, causing an immutable field error.

Evidence: Deployment.apps "vigil-app" is invalid: [spec.template.metadata.labels: Invalid value: {"app":"vigil-app"}: `selector` does not match template `labels`, spec.selector: Invalid value: {"matchLabels":{"app":"vigil-app-typo"}}: field is immutable]

The updated manifest aligns the selector with the pod template labels.","auto_merge":true}
